WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:25.237
Jeremy Fisher was thinking about supper.

2
00:00:25.238 --> 00:00:31.853
"I'm sick of eating flies," he said.

3
00:00:31.854 --> 00:00:35.033
"I know!" Jeremy said.

4
00:00:35.034 --> 00:00:37.331
"I will go fishing.

5
00:00:37.332 --> 00:00:53.622
I will catch a minnow for supper!"

6
00:00:53.623 --> 00:00:59.335
Jeremy got his pail.

7
00:00:59.336 --> 00:01:11.096
He got his fishing rod.

8
00:01:11.097 --> 00:01:19.780
Then he went to the pond.

9
00:01:19.781 --> 00:01:23.519
The farmer was thinking about supper too.

10
00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:25.917
"I know!" he said.

11
00:01:25.918 --> 00:01:28.563
"I will go fishing.

12
00:01:28.564 --> 00:01:36.345
Then I can eat fish for supper."

13
00:01:36.346 --> 00:01:44.746
The farmer got his pail.

14
00:01:44.747 --> 00:01:51.016
He got his fishing rod.

15
00:01:51.017 --> 00:01:56.279
Then he went to the pond.

16
00:01:56.280 --> 00:02:02.325
Jeremy tossed his line into the water.

17
00:02:02.326 --> 00:02:06.799
He saw many ducks.

18
00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:13.893
He saw many flies.

19
00:02:13.894 --> 00:02:17.288
But no minnows swam by.

20
00:02:17.289 --> 00:02:21.046
Jeremy waited and waited . . .

21
00:02:21.047 --> 00:02:25.273
and waited.

22
00:02:25.274 --> 00:02:27.790
"Ugh," Jeremy said.

23
00:02:27.791 --> 00:02:32.762
"I'm getting very hungry."

24
00:02:32.763 --> 00:02:36.084
Suddenly something pulled on his line.

25
00:02:36.085 --> 00:02:39.014
"Yes!" Jeremy cried.

26
00:02:39.015 --> 00:02:43.182
"A fish for supper!"
